18|/***
19| * MARK: DISCOVER_LEG_TIMEOUT_DEFAULT_MS
20| * @description Default per-leg watchdog (ms): a leg that hangs past this
21| *   resolves to its previous slice with a timeout error instead of
22| *   stalling the round. Legs that spawn children (agy, vibe, muse) also
23| *   hand the same budget to their own child watchdog so no orphaned CLI
24| *   outlives the round.
25| * @example DISCOVER_LEG_TIMEOUT_DEFAULT_MS => 20000
26| ***/
27|export const DISCOVER_LEG_TIMEOUT_DEFAULT_MS = 20000;
