157| * MARK: throwLegError
158| * @description Throws a classified leg error: the honest-empty legs and
159| *   the retained catalogue failures raise through here so `runDiscoveryLeg`
160| *   catches a coded reason into the status slot instead of a bare Error.
161| * @example throwLegError('CODEX_DISCOVERY_UNAVAILABLE', 'no live transport', 'wait for the transport')
162| * @param {string} code - Stable status-slot code.
163| * @param {string} message - Human-readable cause.
164| * @param {string} [hint] - Operator fix, shown in Settings.
165| ***/
