65|/***
66| * MARK: discoverClaudeModels
67| * @description Lists the models the installed `muse` CLI can serve, by
68| *   asking it over its own MSP wire protocol (`muse serve` stdio):
69| *   `initialize` → `initialized` → `model/list` (no session needed). Uses
70| *   the box's own login, so the runner never reads keys or calls provider
71| *   billing APIs — only model ids come back. Rows map to the fleet id
72| *   grammar `muse::<providerId>::<modelId>` (e.g.
73| *   `muse::meta::muse-spark-1.3`); malformed rows are skipped, ids deduped.
