138|/***
139| * MARK: validateModelAlias
140| * @description Validates one alias record, returning an error string or null.
141| *   Two shapes are accepted: the legacy single-target record
142| *   (`{ name, harness, model }`, read as one 100% target) and the weighted
143| *   record (`{ name, targets: [{ harness, model, percent }] }` whose
144| *   percents sum to 100). A lone target harness must be a non-empty string
145| *   that is NOT the virtual `alias` id (loop guard); the model accepts any
146| *   model-key form, EXCEPT blank is allowed only for self-managed harnesses
147| *   at dispatch (the settings UI requires a model for `list` harnesses).
