250|/***
251| * MARK: normalizeTargetPercents
252| * @description Spreads 100% evenly across the given targets (largest share
253| *   first for the leftover points, so thirds become 34/33/33), returning
254| *   fresh rows with the same harness + model. Powers the UI's one-click
255| *   "make the rows add to 100%" helper; the API never auto-fixes splits
256| *   (a non-100 payload is refused so the user sees the correction).
