54| * @example // Fetch only while a lazily-opened surface (e.g. a modal) is visible:
55| *   useModelCatalog(FALLBACK_MODELS, { enabled: isOpen });
56| * @param {Array<Object>} fallbackModels - Static model list used when fetching is unavailable or fails.
